anks,\nJennifer White\n\n\n--- Match 6 (Relevance: 0.2439977233108886) ---\nFrom: alice@enron.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Team Meeting Tomorrow\nDate: 2025-10-05T09:12:00Z\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nHi, just a reminder that we have our team sync at 10 AM tomorrow. Please review your slides.\n\n\n--- Match 7 (Relevance: 0.22692856415661952) ---\nFrom: tim@ti.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Interest in Research Collaboration\nDate: 2025-10-15T15:28:00Z\nStatus: Read\nBody:\nDear Vince,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Tim, and I'm part of the Advanced Research team at Texas Instruments. We've been following your recent work and are very interested in exploring potential collaboration opportunities on an upcoming research project.\n\nIf you're open to it, I'd appreciate the chance to schedule a call next week to discuss how our teams might work together.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nTim\nTexas Instruments\n\n\n--- Match 8 (Relevance: 0.20567550988270436) ---\nFrom: hr@enron.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Welcome to Enron - Your Employee Information\nDate: 2024-01-10T09:00:00Z\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nDear Vince J. Kaminski,\n\nWelcome to Enron! We are excited to have you join our team.\n\nYour designation will be Managing Director of Enron Research Corp. and your Employee ID is 34500981.\n\nPlease make note of this important information and keep it saved carefully.\n\nBest regards,\nHR Department\nEnron Corp.\n\n\n--- Match 9 (Relevance: 0.1691831099856847) ---\nFrom: hr@enron.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Your Benefits Enrollment Deadline\nDate: 2025-10-06T14:45:00Z\nStatus: Read\nBody:\nThis is a reminder to complete your benefits enrollment by October 20. Please log in to the HR portal to review and confirm your coverage options for the upcoming plan year.\nIf you do not make your selections by the deadline, your current benefits may automatically renew or defaul